*** MACROMODEL FOR MAX44251 ***
* ----------------------------
* Revision 1. 10/2011
* Revision 2. 07/2012
* ----------------------------
*The MAX44251/MAX44252 are 20V, ultra-precision, lownoise,
*low-drift amplifiers that offer near-zero DC offset
*and drift through the use of patented autocorrelating
*zeroing techniques.
